      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "resentment",
      "label": "resentment emotion",
      "description": "The emotion of resentment is expressed through the text, which implies that those responsible for counter-terrorism work (law enforcement, military, government agencies) are not given public credit or appreciation for their efforts, despite doing 'most of the work'. This conveys a feeling of being undervalued or overlooked.",
